<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia May c/a deficit widens to $89.5 million.</title>
<headline>Slovenia May c/a deficit widens to $89.5 million.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>    figures in millions of dollars     May	April  May95</p>
<p>    Monthly c/a balance		   -89.5   -16.2    -87.7</p>
<p>    Monthly merchandise trade balance -183    -121     -201</p>
<p>NOTE: The Bank of Slovenia does not publish accumulative figures. -- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
